
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Student Life | St. Martin's High School, Balanagar</title>

    <meta name="description"
          content="Discover student life at St. Martin's High School, Balanagar, Hyderabad — sports, academics, creativity, emotional wellness and experiences that shape confident learners.">

    <meta name="theme-color" content="#071A2B">

    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo.png">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
          rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --sl-navy: #071A2B;
            --sl-navy-light: #0C2235;
            --sl-burgundy: #581722;
            --sl-gold: #C5A45A;
            --sl-gold-light: #E0C67B;
            --sl-ivory: #F6F1E7;
            --sl-white: #FFFFFF;
            --sl-muted: #6D7781;
            --sl-border: rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.12);
            --sl-heading: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
            --sl-body: "Inter", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .student-life-page,
        .student-life-page * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .student-life-page {
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--sl-white);
            color: var(--sl-navy);
            font-family: var(--sl-body);
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .student-life-page img {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .student-life-page a {
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .sl-container {
            width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
            margin-inline: auto;
        }

        .sl-eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: var(--sl-gold);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sl-eyebrow::before {
            width: 32px;
            height: 1px;
            background: currentColor;
            content: "";
        }

        .sl-section-title {
            margin: 0 0 22px;
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 60px);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -1.3px;
            line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .sl-section-title em {
            color: var(--sl-burgundy);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .sl-lead {
            max-width: 720px;
            color: var(--sl-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.95;
        }

        /* HERO */

        .sl-hero {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            min-height: 590px;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    90deg,
                    rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.96) 0%,
                    rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.84) 46%,
                    rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.30) 100%
                ),
                url("/images/Legacy.png") center 45% / cover no-repeat;
            color: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-hero::after {
            position: absolute;
            right: -130px;
            bottom: -220px;
            width: 460px;
            height: 460px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(224, 198, 123, 0.25);
            border-radius: 50%;
            content: "";
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .sl-hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            width: min(760px, 100%);
            padding: 100px 0 110px;
        }

        .sl-hero .sl-eyebrow {
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
        }

        .sl-hero h1 {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 0 24px;
            color: var(--sl-white);
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: clamp(54px, 8vw, 92px);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            line-height: 0.98;
        }

        .sl-hero h1 span {
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .sl-hero-description {
            max-width: 590px;
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.95;
        }

        .sl-hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 34px;
        }

        .sl-button {
            display: inline-flex;
            min-height: 49px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 11px;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            font-family: var(--sl-body);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: background 0.25s ease,
                        color 0.25s ease,
                        border-color 0.25s ease,
                        transform 0.25s ease;
        }

        .sl-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .sl-button-gold {
            background: var(--sl-gold);
            color: var(--sl-navy);
        }

        .sl-button-gold:hover {
            background: var(--sl-gold-light);
            color: var(--sl-navy);
        }

        .sl-button-outline {
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.48);
            color: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-button-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--sl-gold);
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
        }

        .sl-hero-note {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 42px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 1.4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sl-hero-note i {
            color: var(--sl-gold);
        }

        /* INTRODUCTION */

        .sl-intro {
            padding: 105px 0;
            background: var(--sl-ivory);
        }

        .sl-intro-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 75px;
        }

        .sl-intro-image {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 410px;
        }

        .sl-intro-image img {
            height: 410px;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center;
        }

        .sl-image-caption {
            position: absolute;
            right: -20px;
            bottom: -22px;
            max-width: 250px;
            padding: 22px 25px;
            background: var(--sl-navy);
            color: var(--sl-white);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.16);
        }

        .sl-image-caption strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .sl-image-caption span {
            display: block;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .sl-intro-copy p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: var(--sl-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 2;
        }

        .sl-inline-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            color: var(--sl-burgundy);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sl-inline-link i {
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .sl-inline-link:hover i {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        /* VALUES */

        .sl-values {
            padding: 90px 0;
            background: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-centered-heading {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto 52px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .sl-centered-heading .sl-eyebrow {
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .sl-centered-heading .sl-lead {
            margin-inline: auto;
        }

        .sl-values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .sl-value-card {
            padding: 34px 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--sl-border);
            background: var(--sl-white);
            transition: border-color 0.25s ease,
                        transform 0.25s ease,
                        box-shadow 0.25s ease;
        }

        .sl-value-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: rgba(197, 164, 90, 0.7);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.07);
        }

        .sl-value-icon {
            display: grid;
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            place-items: center;
            background: var(--sl-ivory);
            color: var(--sl-burgundy);
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .sl-value-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .sl-value-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--sl-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        /* SPORTS FEATURE */

        .sl-sports {
            padding: 100px 0;
            background: var(--sl-navy);
            color: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-sports-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 75px;
        }

        .sl-sports .sl-section-title {
            color: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-sports .sl-section-title em {
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
        }

        .sl-sports .sl-lead {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        }

        .sl-sports-copy > p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 2;
        }

        .sl-sports-image {
            position: relative;
            padding: 0 0 20px 20px;
        }

        .sl-sports-image::before {
            position: absolute;
            top: -17px;
            left: 0;
            width: 70%;
            height: 70%;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--sl-gold);
            border-left: 2px solid var(--sl-gold);
            content: "";
        }

        .sl-sports-image img {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            height: 430px;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center;
            background: #132D42;
        }

        .sl-sports-image figcaption {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sl-sports-image figcaption i {
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
        }

        .sl-sports-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 13px 20px;
            margin: 28px 0 32px;
            padding: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .sl-sports-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .sl-sports-list i {
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        /* STUDENT EXPERIENCES */

        .sl-experiences {
            padding: 105px 0;
            background: #FBFAF7;
        }

        .sl-experience-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .sl-experience-card {
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--sl-border);
            background: var(--sl-white);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease,
                        box-shadow 0.25s ease;
        }

        .sl-experience-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.09);
        }

        .sl-experience-image {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #EAE6DE;
        }

        .sl-experience-image img {
            height: 245px;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.55s ease;
        }

        .sl-experience-card:hover .sl-experience-image img {
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }

        .sl-experience-content {
            padding: 25px 24px 28px;
        }

        .sl-card-number {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 9px;
            color: var(--sl-gold);
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .sl-experience-content h3 {
            margin: 0 0 11px;
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: 29px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .sl-experience-content p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--sl-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.95;
        }

        /* WELLNESS */

        .sl-wellness {
            padding: 95px 0;
            background: var(--sl-ivory);
        }

        .sl-wellness-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 70px;
        }

        .sl-wellness-points {
            display: grid;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .sl-wellness-point {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
            gap: 17px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .sl-wellness-point > span {
            display: grid;
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            place-items: center;
            background: var(--sl-white);
            color: var(--sl-burgundy);
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .sl-wellness-point h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }

        .sl-wellness-point p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--sl-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        /* QUOTE */

        .sl-quote {
            position: relative;
            padding: 86px 24px;
            background: var(--sl-burgundy);
            color: var(--sl-white);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .sl-quote-mark {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--sl-gold-light);
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            font-size: 68px;
            line-height: 0.8;
        }

        .sl-quote blockquote {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: clamp(30px, 4.6vw, 48px);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .sl-quote p {
            margin: 24px 0 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* PHOTO GALLERY */

        .sl-gallery {
            padding: 100px 0;
            background: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .sl-gallery-item {
            position: relative;
            min-width: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--sl-ivory);
        }

        .sl-gallery-item img {
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .sl-gallery-item:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }

        .sl-gallery-item figcaption {
            padding: 14px 15px;
            background: var(--sl-ivory);
            color: var(--sl-navy);
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }

        /* CTA */

        .sl-cta {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 90px 0;
            background: var(--sl-navy);
            color: var(--sl-white);
        }

        .sl-cta::after {
            position: absolute;
            top: -170px;
            right: -110px;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 164, 90, 0.25);
            border-radius: 50%;
            content: "";
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .sl-cta-inner {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .sl-cta h2 {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            color: var(--sl-white);
            font-family: var(--sl-heading);
            font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .sl-cta p {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        /* REVEAL ANIMATION */

        .sl-reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(22px);
            transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
        }

        .sl-reveal.sl-visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */

        @media (max-width: 1000px) {
            .sl-intro-grid,
            .sl-sports-grid,
            .sl-wellness-grid {
                gap: 42px;
            }

            .sl-gallery-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .sl-experience-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .sl-values-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .sl-cta-inner {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .sl-container {
                width: min(100% - 36px, 560px);
            }

            .sl-hero {
                min-height: 540px;
                background-position: 60% center;
            }

            .sl-hero-content {
                padding: 80px 0;
            }

            .sl-hero h1 {
                font-size: clamp(48px, 13vw, 72px);
                letter-spacing: -1px;
            }

            .sl-hero-description {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .sl-intro,
            .sl-values,
            .sl-experiences,
            .sl-gallery {
                padding: 70px 0;
            }

            .sl-sports,
            .sl-wellness {
                padding: 75px 0;
            }

            .sl-intro-grid,
            .sl-sports-grid,
            .sl-wellness-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 45px;
            }

            .sl-intro-image {
                margin-right: 12px;
            }

            .sl-intro-image img {
                height: 310px;
            }

            .sl-image-caption {
                right: -12px;
                max-width: 220px;
            }

            .sl-values-grid,
            .sl-experience-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .sl-centered-heading {
                margin-bottom: 35px;
            }

            .sl-sports-image img {
                height: 320px;
            }

            .sl-sports-list {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .sl-experience-image img {
                height: 250px;
            }

            .sl-gallery-grid {
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .sl-gallery-item img {
                height: 165px;
            }

            .sl-gallery-item figcaption {
                padding: 11px;
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .sl-quote {
                padding: 65px 22px;
            }

            .sl-cta {
                padding: 70px 0;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .sl-gallery-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .sl-gallery-item img {
                height: 230px;
            }

            .sl-hero-actions {
                align-items: stretch;
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .sl-button {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .student-life-page *,
            .student-life-page *::before,
            .student-life-page *::after {
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            }

            .sl-reveal {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- GLOBAL HEADER -->
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="student-life-page">

        <!-- HERO -->
        <section class="sl-hero">
            <div class="sl-container">
                <div class="sl-hero-content sl-reveal">
                    <span class="sl-eyebrow">Life at St. Martin's</span>

                    <h1>
                        More Than<br>
                        <span>Classrooms.</span><br>
                        A Way of Life.
                    </h1>

                    <p class="sl-hero-description">
                        Where learning becomes experience, friendships grow into
                        lasting memories, and every student discovers new ways
                        to learn, lead, create and achieve.
                    </p>

                    <div class="sl-hero-actions">
                        <a href="#student-experiences" class="sl-button sl-button-gold">
                            Discover Student Life
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </a>

                        <a href="#student-gallery" class="sl-button sl-button-outline">
                            Explore Our Moments
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sl-hero-note">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i>
                        Balanagar, Hyderabad
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
        <section class="sl-intro">
            <div class="sl-container">
                <div class="sl-intro-grid">

                    <div class="sl-intro-image sl-reveal">
                        <img
                            src="/images/Legacy.png"
                            alt="Students and school life at St. Martin's High School"
                            loading="lazy"
                            onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/The-Spirit-Of-Sport.png';"
                        >

                        <div class="sl-image-caption">
                            <strong>Growing Together</strong>
                            <span>Building knowledge, confidence, character and lifelong friendships.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sl-intro-copy sl-reveal">
                        <span class="sl-eyebrow">The Student Experience</span>

                        <h2 class="sl-section-title">
                            Every Day Is an Opportunity to <em>Discover.</em>
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            At St. Martin's High School, student life extends
                            beyond textbooks and examinations. It is a journey
                            of discovery in which curiosity is encouraged,
                            talents are nurtured and individual potential is
                            given room to grow.
                        </p>

                        <p>
